changes.after:
[
    {
        "text": "Now the air has gone foul. Sulfur blightmaws are nesting in the vents and my lungs cannot take another week of it.",
        "side": "default",
        "left_speaker_id": 0,
        "right_speaker_id": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "Eight of the beasts should thin them out, and I need vitriol roots for the salve - three will do.",
        "side": "default",
        "left_speaker_id": 0,
        "right_speaker_id": -1
    },
    {
        "action": true,
        "text": "Do that and you will have a friend in this cave. Friends are worth more than gold down here.",
        "side": "default",
        "left_speaker_id": 0,
        "right_speaker_id": -1
    }
]

[
    {
        "text": "So you are the one who cleared my order. Reliable hands - and in this cave that is rarer than amethyst.",
        "side": "default",
        "left_speaker_id": 0,
        "right_speaker_id": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "Speaking of amethyst: the prisms in the lower galleries have started to bloom. Pretty things, but they hum loud enough to crack a lamp.",
        "side": "default",
        "left_speaker_id": 0,
        "right_speaker_id": -1
    },
    {
        "action": true,
        "text": "Break twelve of them before the whole vein wakes up. I will pay well, and I will pretend I did not see you pocket a shard.",
        "side": "default",
        "left_speaker_id": 0,
        "right_speaker_id": -1
    }
]

[
    {
        "text": "Hoy there, <player>. Mind the drips - cave water eats through leather and patience alike.",
        "side": "default",
        "left_speaker_id": 0,
        "right_speaker_id": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "I am the only trader for a mile of tunnels, and my shelves are bare. No copper, no coal, no business.",
        "side": "default",
        "left_speaker_id": 0,
        "right_speaker_id": -1
    },
    {
        "action": true,
        "text": "Bring me five chunks of copper ore and five of coal from the seams up top, and I will make it worth your while.",
        "side": "default",
        "left_speaker_id": 0,
        "right_speaker_id": -1
    }
]

[
    {
        "text": "Copper, coal, amethyst - if it glitters in the dark, I sell it. Bring me ore and we will talk business.",
        "side": "default",
        "left_speaker_id": 0,
        "right_speaker_id": -1,
        "action": true
    }
]
